⎕TRAP←(0 'E' '⎕←⎕DM ⋄ ⎕OFF 1')
⎕IO←0
{}⎕FIX 'file://src/ImageOps.dyalog'
Assert←{⍵:1 ⋄ ⎕SIGNAL 11}
⎕←'Row-filter timing, milliseconds/call; 200 calls per sample, median of 5 samples'
⎕←'length radius stencil_ms matrix_ms'
:For n :In 64 256 1024
    row←256|37×⍳n
    :For radius :In 1 4
        k←ImageOps.GaussianKernel radius 1
        a←(k 'reflect') ImageOps.FilterRow row
        b←(k 'reflect') ImageOps.MatrixFilterRow row
        {}Assert 1E¯9>⌈/|a-b
        times←2 5⍴0
        :For run :In ⍳5
            start←⎕AI[2]
            :For repeat :In ⍳200
                a←(k 'reflect') ImageOps.FilterRow row
            :EndFor
            times[0;run]←(⎕AI[2]-start)÷200
            start←⎕AI[2]
            :For repeat :In ⍳200
                b←(k 'reflect') ImageOps.MatrixFilterRow row
            :EndFor
            times[1;run]←(⎕AI[2]-start)÷200
        :EndFor
        stencil←times[0;] ⋄ matrix←times[1;]
        ⎕←n radius,stencil[2⊃⍋stencil],matrix[2⊃⍋matrix]
    :EndFor
:EndFor
⎕OFF 0
